  "subtitle": "a fragrant, dense loaf cake with rose water and pistachio",
  "excerpt": "This Persian-inspired yoghurt cake is fragrant with cardamom and rose water, dense and moist from the full-fat yoghurt, and scattered with chopped pistachios over the top before baking. It is a simple, one-bowl cake that comes together quickly, with a soft, tight crumb and a flavour that is pronounced without being rich. It keeps well for three days and improves from the fridge.",
